      "content": "Since phone support hasn't been helpful, your next step should be to gather documentation and explore alternatives. Document every suspicious charge, fee increase, and interaction with the credit union. Consider moving your primary checking and savings accounts to a different, established financial institution immediately for maximum protection. Additionally, you can file a complaint with the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau (CFPB) regarding their unsatisfactory service.",
