    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "moving everything to a big bank feels like just giving up and letting them win. if they're monitoring my activity to time these \"glitches\" and \"fees,\" i feel like anything i do within their system is just giving them more data to use against me. are there any ways to move money or manage my finances that are more... under the radar? like, ways to bypass their automated targeting systems so they can't see where my money is actually going?",
